This product links OpenSSL 3 (libssl and libcrypto), licensed under
Apache-2.0. The Windows data-plane zip vendors libssl-3-x64.dll and
libcrypto-3-x64.dll from the OpenSSL build tree used to link the binaries.
macOS binaries statically link libssl.a and libcrypto.a from the build machine’s
OPENSSL_PREFIX (Homebrew or MacPorts); no package-manager OpenSSL is needed at
runtime. PROVENANCE.txt records that prefix and its bin/openssl version.
Linux dynamically links system OpenSSL, not vendored.
See docs/DEPENDENCIES.md.
